# default-src covers scripts, workers, styles and fonts. Map tiles, glyphs and sprites come from
# OpenFreeMap, and MapLibre draws images from data: and blob: URLs. index.html has no inline
# script or style because angular.json turns off critical CSS inlining.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org; img-src 'self' data: blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), hid=(), midi=(), display-capture=(), browsing-topics=()

# Previews are public for review, but search engines must only index production.
https://:preview.pulse.vladdancea.com/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# worker/cache-headers.mjs appends the long-lived caching rules for the built files.
